appendix.Functional Requirements:
Requirements for security Log retention:
Generally, security Logs should be retained for an extended period of time, which may vary in the area, type of the logged event, need, associated risks, etc. By default security related Logs in Central Log Retention Platform shall be stored for 12 months.



When the retention period is over, Logs must be deleted automatically;
Systems shall ensure Logs storage until successful sending to the Central Log Retention Platform (see AU-2);
The Central Log Retention Platform and Systems that store Logs must have an adequate storage space for the Logs generated (see AU-4).

