appendix.Control Objective:
Develop, document, and disseminate an identification and authentication process and below procedures (can be combined with AC-1 process and procedures) that:
Define purpose, scope, roles, responsibilities, and compliance;
Align with applicable laws, policies, and standards; 
Ensure an official is designated to manage, review, and update the process and procedures regularly.

Luminor must ensure that users are re-authenticated before accessing sensitive information or performing critical operations. This includes:
Requiring re-authentication at regular intervals or after a period of inactivity;
Implementing re-authentication for high-privilege operations or access to sensitive data;
Using re-authentication as a security measure to confirm user identity and prevent unauthorized access.

nist.nist_requirements:
