appendix.Control Objective:
Ensure that Luminor uniquely identifies and authenticates all organizational users before allowing access to the organization’s information systems. Procedures should:
Require unique identifiers for each user;
Use multi-factor authentication (MFA) for privileged accounts and sensitive access points;
Ensure ongoing monitoring and revocation processes for credentials.

Luminor must ensure that devices accessing the organization's information systems are uniquely identified and authenticated before access is granted. This includes:
Establishing mechanisms to verify device identity before network access;
Ensuring devices are authenticated upon initial connection and at periodic intervals;
Implementing secure identification protocols for all device types, including remote and mobile devices.

