appendix.Control Objective:
Luminor must establish, manage, and control identifiers for individual users and devices to ensure unique identification across the organization’s information systems. This includes:
Assigning unique identifiers to each user (Account IDs) and device;
Ensuring that identifiers are securely managed throughout their lifecycle;
Enforcing strict controls over the creation, assignment, and deactivation of identifiers.

