SI-2: Flaw Remediation enhancement:
SI-2(3): Time to Remediate Flaws and Benchmarks for Corrective Actions. Measure the time between flaw identification and flaw remediation.
Default vulnerabilities remediation timeframes:
Urgent: Vulnerability shall be handled as priority during 2 business days. 
Critical: 35 calendar days 
High (scanner definition): 60 calendar days
Medium (scanner definition): 90 calendar days
Low (scanner definition): 120 calendar days
If remediation cannot be done on time or at all, an IT risk or exception shall be registered.
