identify and evaluate available software and hardware patches and updates using automated tools (if not possible update manually);
identify emergency procedures for the patching and updating of IT assets;
test and deploy the software and hardware patches and the updates at least monthly; 
set deadlines for the installation of software and hardware patches and updates and escalation procedures in case those deadlines cannot be met.

